124","provider":"125","model":"126","system-message":"127","user-message":"128","stepName":"129","sequence":"130","statusWebhook":"131","totalSteps":"132"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"133","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"134"},{"item":0},{"text":null,"provider":"125","model":null,"usage":null},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","openai","gpt-4o","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","1","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"role":"135","content":"136","refusal":null,"annotations":"137"},"stop","assistant","Exciting news! We’re thrilled to introduce our newest creation: Orchestrator AI, a powerful yet user-friendly tool crafted specifically to empower small businesses. \\n\\nIn today’s rapidly evolving digital landscape, staying competitive means juggling multiple tasks—from managing customer relationships to streamlining operations and marketing efforts. We saw an opportunity to simplify this complexity with Orchestrator AI, an all-in-one solution designed to fit the unique needs and budgets of small businesses.\\n\\nWhat makes Orchestrator AI stand out? For starters, its intuitive interface means you don’t need to be a tech whiz to harness its potential. Whether you’re automating customer outreach, managing sales pipelines, or analyzing business data, Orchestrator AI handles it all seamlessly, freeing up your valuable time to focus on what you do best—growing your business.\\n\\nMoreover, it’s built with flexibility in mind. Small businesses often wear many hats, so our AI adapts to your workflows, not the other way around. Plus, its scalable features mean you can start small and expand as your business grows.\\n\\nWe believe Orchestrator AI is more than just a tool—it’s a game-changer that levels the playing field, giving small businesses access to cutting-edge technology once reserved for large corporations. We’re excited to see how it helps our community thrive, innovate, and succeed.\\n\\nReady to take the next step? Stay tuned for more updates, tutorials, and success stories coming soon. Here’s to your business’s bright future with Orchestrator AI!",[]]
