:"119"},{"json":"115","pairedItem":"120"},{},{"item":0},{"source":"121","taskId":"122","conversationId":"123","userId":"124","provider":"125","model":"126","system-message":"127","user-message":"128","stepName":"129","sequence":"130","statusWebhook":"131","totalSteps":"132"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"133","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"134"},{"item":0},{"text":null,"provider":"125","model":null,"usage":null},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"click","{{ $json.taskId || \\"a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890\\" }}","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","openai","gpt-4o","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","1","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"role":"135","content":"136","refusal":null,"annotations":"137"},"stop","assistant","We are excited to introduce our latest innovation: Orchestrator AI! Designed specifically with small businesses in mind, Orchestrator AI is here to streamline your operations, boost efficiency, and help you stay ahead in today’s competitive landscape.  \\n\\nIn the fast-paced world of small business, wearing multiple hats is just part of the gig. From managing daily tasks to engaging with customers and planning for growth, it can sometimes feel overwhelming. That’s where Orchestrator AI steps in—it’s like having a dedicated operations manager at your side, but smarter and more adaptable.  \\n\\nSo, what makes Orchestrator AI the perfect fit for small businesses? Well, it combines powerful automation capabilities with intuitive insights, all tailored to your unique needs. Whether you’re organizing schedules, managing customer relationships, or tracking inventory, Orchestrator AI simplifies these processes so you can focus on what you do best—serving your customers and growing your business.  \\n\\nOne of the best parts? It’s designed to be user-friendly and affordable, making advanced AI tools accessible to businesses of all sizes. No complex setup, no steep learning curve—just straightforward solutions that make a real difference.  \\n\\nWe believe that small businesses are the backbone of our communities, and with Orchestrator AI, we’re empowering you with the tools to thrive. We can’t wait to see how you leverage it to take your business to new heights!  \\n\\nStay tuned for more updates, demos, and success stories. Here’s to smarter business operations with Orchestrator AI!",[]]
