ration":"139","name":"140"},{"text":null,"provider":"169","model":null,"usage":"170"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"source":"171","taskId":"172","conversationId":"173","userId":"174","provider":"169","model":"175","system-message":"176","user-message":"177","stepName":"178","sequence":"115","statusWebhook":"179","totalSteps":"180"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"response":"181","tokenUsageEstimate":"182"},{"messages":"183","estimatedTokens":56,"options":"184"},{"output":"185"},{"item":0},{"item":0},"ollama",{},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","llama3.2:1b","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"generations":"186"},{"completionTokens":517,"promptTokens":56,"totalTokens":573},["187"],{"lc":1,"type":"188","id":"189"},"**Introducing Orchestrator AI: The Symphony of Efficiency for Small Businesses**\\n\\nExciting news for entrepreneurs and business owners everywhere! We're thrilled to announce the launch of Orchestrator AI, a game-changing solution tailored to meet the unique needs of small businesses.\\n\\nIn today's fast-paced, competitive landscape, small businesses face countless challenges that can make or break their success. From managing day-to-day operations to staying ahead of the curve in terms of innovation and growth, it can be overwhelming to keep up with the demands of running a business.\\n\\nThat's where Orchestrator AI comes in – an innovative, AI-powered platform designed to help small businesses streamline their processes, boost productivity, and drive growth. With its intuitive interface and cutting-edge technology, Orchestrator AI is poised to become the go-to solution for entrepreneurs and business owners looking to take their operations to the next level.\\n\\n**What Can Orchestrator AI Do for Your Business?**\\n\\n* **Automate repetitive tasks**: Say goodbye to tedious manual labor and hello to more free time with our AI-powered automation tools.\\n* **Improve data insights**: Get real-time data analytics and actionable recommendations to inform your business decisions.\\n* **Enhance customer experience**: Deliver personalized, omnichannel experiences that leave a lasting impression on your customers.\\n* **Foster collaboration**: Seamlessly connect teams and stakeholders with our intuitive communication platform.\\n\\n**Why Choose Orchestrator AI?**\\n\\n* **Affordable pricing**: Our scalable solution is designed to fit the unique needs of small businesses, without breaking the bank.\\n* **Customizable**: Tailor your experience to suit your business goals and objectives.\\n* **Security**: Your data is safe with us – we've implemented top-notch security measures to protect your sensitive information.\\n\\n**Get Ready to Conduct**\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is more than just a tool – it's a partner in your business journey. With its user-friendly interface, seamless integration capabilities, and cutting-edge technology, you'll be able to:\\n\\n* **Streamline operations**: Eliminate bottlenecks and inefficiencies with our expertly designed workflows.\\n* **Boost productivity**: Focus on high-leverage activities that drive growth and revenue.\\n* **Stay ahead of the curve**: Leverage our AI-powered insights to anticipate market trends and make informed decisions.\\n\\n**Join the Symphony**\\n\\nDon't miss out on this opportunity to transform your business with Orchestrator AI. Try it today and experience the power of efficiency, productivity, and innovation for yourself.\\n\\nOrder now and discover a new way to conduct – with Orchestrator AI by your side!",["190"],"System: You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. \\nHuman: We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","not_implemented",["191","192","169","193"],["194"],"langchain","chat_models","ChatOllama",{"text":"185"}]
