9","singleValue":true},{"type":"138","operation":"139","singleValue":true},{"text":null,"provider":"168","model":null,"usage":"169"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"source":"170","taskId":"171","conversationId":"172","userId":"173","provider":"168","model":"174","system-message":"175","user-message":"176","stepName":"177","sequence":"116","statusWebhook":"178","totalSteps":"179"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"response":"180","tokenUsageEstimate":"181"},{"messages":"182","estimatedTokens":56,"options":"183"},{"output":"184"},{"item":0},{"item":0},"ollama",{},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","llama3.2:1b","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"generations":"185"},{"completionTokens":494,"promptTokens":56,"totalTokens":550},["186"],{"lc":1,"type":"187","id":"188"},"**\\"Conducting Your Business with Ease: Introducing Orchestrator AI - The Ultimate Tool for Small Businesses\\"**\\n\\nAre you tired of feeling like your business is a symphony in disarray? With too many instruments playing at once, it's hard to keep everything harmonious and on track. That's where our latest innovation comes in: Orchestrator AI.\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is a game-changing tool specifically designed for small businesses like yours. This cutting-edge technology streamlines your operations, automates tasks, and brings all the elements of your business into perfect harmony.\\n\\n**What Problem Does Orchestrator AI Solve?**\\n\\nAs a small business owner, you wear many hats - from sales to marketing, finance to HR. But with so much on your plate, it's easy to lose sight of what's really important: running an efficient and effective operation.\\n\\nThat's where Orchestrator AI comes in. This powerful tool takes care of the little things that drive you crazy, like:\\n\\n* Scheduling appointments and meetings\\n* Managing customer relationships\\n* Analyzing sales data and predicting trends\\n* Automating routine tasks and workflows\\n\\n**How Does Orchestrator AI Work?**\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is designed to be user-friendly and intuitive. Simply input your business goals and objectives, and our AI technology will take care of the rest.\\n\\nUsing advanced machine learning algorithms, Orchestrator AI analyzes your data and identifies areas where you can improve efficiency and productivity. Then, it puts in place a customized plan to help you achieve those goals.\\n\\n**What Sets Orchestrator AI Apart?**\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is more than just another business management tool - it's a game-changer. Here are just a few reasons why:\\n\\n* **Seamless Integration**: Orchestrator AI integrates seamlessly with all your existing tools and software, so you don't have to worry about switching platforms or learning new systems.\\n* **Personalized Support**: Our dedicated team is always here to help, providing personalized support and guidance every step of the way.\\n* **Ongoing Updates**: We're committed to keeping our technology up-to-date and evolving with your business needs.\\n\\n**Get Ready to Harmonize Your Business**\\n\\nDon't let disorganization hold you back any longer. Try Orchestrator AI today and experience the power of streamlined operations, automated tasks, and a more efficient you!\\n\\nContact us to learn more about Orchestrator AI and how it can transform your small business into a symphony of success!",["189"],"System: You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. \\nHuman: We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","not_implemented",["190","191","168","192"],["193"],"langchain","chat_models","ChatOllama",{"text":"184"}]
