c3-546d-4791-ba38-c008bee14f29","=1 {{ $('Ollama') !== null && $('Ollama').item.json.output }}","1",{"type":"160","operation":"161","singleValue":true},{"id":"137","leftValue":"138","rightValue":"121","operator":"162"},{"id":"140","leftValue":"141","rightValue":"142","operator":"163"},{"text":null,"provider":"164","model":null,"usage":"165"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"source":"166","taskId":"167","conversationId":"168","userId":"169","provider":"164","model":"170","system-message":"171","user-message":"172","stepName":"173","sequence":"142","statusWebhook":"174","totalSteps":"175"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"response":"176","tokenUsageEstimate":"177"},{"messages":"178","estimatedTokens":56,"options":"179"},{"output":"180"},{"item":0},{"item":0},"string","notEmpty",{"type":"160","operation":"161","singleValue":true},{"type":"160","operation":"161","singleValue":true},"ollama",{},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","llama3.2:1b","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"generations":"181"},{"completionTokens":511,"promptTokens":56,"totalTokens":567},["182"],{"lc":1,"type":"183","id":"184"},"**Introducing Orchestrator AI: The Game-Changing Solution for Small Businesses**\\n\\nIn today's fast-paced and ever-evolving business landscape, small companies face a multitude of challenges that can make it difficult to stay ahead of the curve. From managing multiple tasks and projects simultaneously to making data-driven decisions, entrepreneurs often find themselves struggling to keep up with the demands of their growing businesses.\\n\\nThat's where Orchestrator AI comes in – a revolutionary new product designed specifically for small businesses like yours. This innovative solution is poised to transform the way you work, streamline your operations, and drive growth.\\n\\n**What is Orchestrator AI?**\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is an artificial intelligence-powered platform that uses machine learning algorithms to analyze your business data, identify areas of inefficiency, and provide actionable insights to help you make better decisions. With its intuitive interface and user-friendly design, Orchestrator AI makes it easy to integrate into your existing workflow, no matter how complex or disparate.\\n\\n**Key Features of Orchestrator AI**\\n\\n* **Automated Task Management**: Say goodbye to tedious task management with Orchestrator AI's automated system, which assigns tasks based on priority and deadlines.\\n* **Real-Time Data Analysis**: Get instant insights into your business performance with Orchestrator AI's real-time data analysis capabilities.\\n* **Predictive Analytics**: Stay ahead of the curve with predictive analytics that forecast sales trends, customer behavior, and market shifts.\\n* **Personalized Recommendations**: Receive tailored suggestions for improving operations, increasing revenue, and optimizing resources.\\n\\n**Benefits of Using Orchestrator AI**\\n\\n* **Increased Productivity**: Streamline your workflows and focus on high-priority tasks with Orchestrator AI's automated systems.\\n* **Improved Decision-Making**: Make informed decisions with data-driven insights that provide a competitive edge.\\n* **Enhanced Customer Experience**: Deliver exceptional customer service with personalized recommendations and tailored support.\\n* **Cost Savings**: Reduce waste, minimize errors, and optimize resources with Orchestrator AI's intelligent optimization capabilities.\\n\\n**Get Ready to Revolutionize Your Business**\\n\\nDon't miss out on the opportunity to transform your small business with Orchestrator AI. Contact us today to schedule a demo and discover how this innovative solution can help you:\\n\\n* Increase revenue by up to 20%\\n* Boost productivity by up to 30%\\n* Enhance customer satisfaction by up to 25%\\n\\nJoin the ranks of forward-thinking businesses that are already experiencing the power of Orchestrator AI. Together, let's orchestrate success for your small business!",["185"],"System: You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. \\nHuman: We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","not_implemented",["186","187","164","188"],["189"],"langchain","chat_models","ChatOllama",{"text":"180"}]
