167"},{"type":"138","operation":"139","singleValue":true},{"type":"138","operation":"139","singleValue":true},{"text":"168","provider":"169","model":"170","usage":"171"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"source":"172","taskId":"173","conversationId":"174","userId":"175","provider":"169","model":"170","system-message":"176","user-message":"177","stepName":"178","sequence":"116","statusWebhook":"179","totalSteps":"180"},{"item":0},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"response":"181","tokenUsageEstimate":"182"},{"messages":"183","estimatedTokens":56,"options":"184"},{"output":"168"},{"item":0},{"item":0},"**Introducing Orchestrator AI: The Ultimate Game-Changer for Small Business Success**\\n\\nIn today's fast-paced business landscape, small companies face a multitude of challenges that can make or break their growth and profitability. From managing day-to-day operations to making informed strategic decisions, the stakes are high. That's why we're thrilled to announce the launch of Orchestrator AI, a revolutionary new product designed specifically for small businesses like yours.\\n\\n**What is Orchestrator AI?**\\n\\nOrchestrator AI is an artificial intelligence-powered platform that streamlines business operations, automates repetitive tasks, and provides actionable insights to help small businesses make data-driven decisions. By harnessing the power of machine learning and natural language processing, Orchestrator AI helps entrepreneurs and business owners:\\n\\n* **Boost productivity**: Automate routine tasks and focus on high-value activities\\n* **Improve efficiency**: Optimize workflows, reduce waste, and minimize downtime\\n* **Enhance decision-making**: Access real-time data insights and make informed choices\\n* **Increase competitiveness**: Stay ahead of the curve with predictive analytics and strategic recommendations\\n\\n**How Does Orchestrator AI Work?**\\n\\nOur innovative platform uses advanced algorithms to analyze your business operations, identify areas for improvement, and provide personalized recommendations. With a user-friendly interface, you'll be able to:\\n\\n* **Connect with our AI engine**: Share data, processes, and goals to create a tailored solution\\n* **Monitor progress and adjust**: Track key performance indicators (KPIs) and refine your strategy as needed\\n* **Leverage expert insights**: Tap into our team of business experts for guidance and support\\n\\n**Why Small Businesses Need Orchestrator AI**\\n\\nIn today's digital age, small businesses need a competitive edge to thrive. By investing in Orchestrator AI, you'll:\\n\\n* **Level the playing field**: Stay ahead of larger competitors with cutting-edge technology\\n* **Gain a strategic advantage**: Make data-driven decisions and stay agile in a rapidly changing market\\n* **Unlock new opportunities**: Discover hidden revenue streams and expand your reach\\n\\n**Get Ready to Take Your Business to the Next Level**\\n\\nWe're excited to introduce Orchestrator AI to small businesses everywhere. With its powerful AI engine, intuitive interface, and expert support, this platform is poised to revolutionize the way you run your business.\\n\\n**Sign up now** and discover a smarter way to manage your operations, drive growth, and achieve success.","ollama","llama3.2:1b",{},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"generations":"185"},{"completionTokens":490,"promptTokens":56,"totalTokens":546},["186"],{"lc":1,"type":"187","id":"188"},["189"],"System: You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and info