"37"},{"startTime":1760156080233,"executionIndex":2,"source":"38","hints":"39","executionTime":5,"executionStatus":"33","data":"40"},{"startTime":1760156080238,"executionIndex":3,"source":"41","hints":"42","executionTime":0,"executionStatus":"33","data":"43"},{"startTime":1760156080238,"executionIndex":4,"source":"44","hints":"45","executionTime":5941,"executionStatus":"33","data":"46"},{"startTime":1760156086180,"executionIndex":5,"source":"47","hints":"48","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"49"},{"startTime":1760156086181,"executionIndex":6,"source":"50","hints":"51","executionTime":18,"executionStatus":"33","data":"52"},{"startTime":1760156086199,"executionIndex":7,"source":"53","hints":"54","executionTime":0,"executionStatus":"33","data":"55"},[],[],{"parentExecution":"4"},"success",{"main":"56"},["57"],[],{"main":"58"},["59"],[],{"main":"60"},["61"],[],{"main":"62"},["63"],[],{"main":"64"},["65"],[],{"main":"66"},["67"],[],{"main":"68"},["69"],[],{"main":"70"},["71"],{"previousNode":"72"},["73"],{"previousNode":"74"},["75"],{"previousNode":"74"},["76","77","78"],{"previousNode":"79"},["80"],{"previousNode":"81"},["82"],{"previousNode":"83"},["84"],{"previousNode":"83"},["85"],["86"],"Trigger",["87"],"Edit Fields",["88"],["89"],[],[],"Select Provider",["90"],"OpenAI",["91"],"Normalize OpenAI",["92"],["93"],{"json":"94","index":0,"pairedItem":"95"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"97"},{"json":"98","pairedItem":"99"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"100"},{"json":"101","pairedItem":"102"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"104"},{"json":"105","pairedItem":"106"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"107"},{"provider":"108","model":"109","announcement":"110","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","statusWebhook":"114","system-message":"115","user-message":"110","stepName":"116","sequence":"117","totalSteps":"117"},{"item":0},{"source":"118","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","provider":"108","model":"109","system-message":"119","user-message":"120","stepName":"121","sequence":"117","statusWebhook":"114","totalSteps":"117"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"122","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"123"},{"item":0},{"text":null,"provider":"108","model":null,"usage":null},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","Blog post content has been generated","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You are an expert at planning and writing social media posts for just about any topic","Create Social Media","3","click","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Create Social Media ",{"role":"124","content":"125","refusal":null,"annotations":"126"},"stop","assistant","Exciting News! Introducing Orchestrator AI — The Perfect Solution for Small Businesses\\n\\nHey everyone! We’re thrilled to share some fantastic news with you today. After months of development and feedback from countless small business owners, we’re proud to unveil our latest innovation: **Orchestrator AI**. Designed specifically with small businesses in mind, this powerful new tool is set to transform the way you operate, grow, and streamline your day-to-day tasks.\\n\\nWhy We Created Orchestrator AI\\n\\nRunning a small business is no small feat. Juggling multiple roles, managing operations, marketing, customer service, and everything in between can feel overwhelming. That’s where Orchestrator AI comes in. We saw a need for an intelligent, easy-to-use solution that helps small businesses orchestrate their activities smoothly and efficiently—without requiring a huge team or a steep learning curve.\\n\\nWhat Is Orchestrator AI?\\n\\nThink of Orchestrator AI as your smart business conductor. It intelligently manages and automates various components of your operations—from scheduling and workflow automation to customer engagement and data analysis. Whether you're a boutique retailer, a local service provider, or a startup trying to wear many hats, Orchestrator AI adapts to your unique needs.\\n\\nKey Features & Benefits\\n\\n1. **Automation of Repetitive Tasks**  \\nFree up your time by automating routine activities like appointment scheduling, email follow-ups, and inventory updates. Focus on what you do best—serving your customers!\\n\\n2. **Intelligent Workflow Management**  \\nCreate and customize workflows that streamline your processes. Orchestrator AI ensures everything runs smoothly, alerting you to potential bottlenecks before they become problems.\\n\\n3. **Customer Engagement & Support**  \\nImprove your customer communications with personalized messaging and AI-powered chatbots. Keep clients happy and engaged without extra effort.\\n\\n4. **Data Insights & Reporting**  \\nMake smarter decisions with easy-to-understand reports on sales, customer preferences, and business health metrics. Knowledge is power!\\n\\n5. **User-Friendly Interface**  \\nNo tech jargon or complicated setup. Orchestrator AI features an intuitive dashboard designed to get you up and running in no time.\\n\\nWho Is It For?\\n\\nSmall businesses across all industries can benefit—from retail shops and restaurants to consulting agencies and creative studios. If you’re looking to save time, reduce errors, and make data-driven decisions, Orchestrator AI is the partner you need.\\n\\nWhat’s Next?\\n\\nWe’re launching Orchestrator AI with a free trial, so you can experience firsthand how it can revolutionize your business operations. Stay tuned for webinars, tutorials, and success stories from early adopters. We’re committed to supporting small businesses every step of the way.\\n\\nFinal Thoughts\\n\\nOwning a small business is challenging, but managing it doesn’t have to be chaotic. With Orchestrator AI, you're equipped with a powerful ally that helps you orchestrate your success seamlessly. We believe this tool will empower you to focus more on what matters most—your passion, your customers, and your growth.\\n\\nThanks for being part of our journey. Here’s to smarter, simpler, and more successful small businesses!\\n\\nReady to get started? Visit our website for more details and to sign up for the free trial!\\n\\n---\\n\\nFeel free to reach out with any questions or share your thoughts—we love hearing from our community!",[]]
