onTime":4,"executionStatus":"34","data":"41"},{"startTime":1760156225852,"executionIndex":3,"source":"42","hints":"43","executionTime":0,"executionStatus":"34","data":"44"},{"startTime":1760156225853,"executionIndex":4,"source":"45","hints":"46","executionTime":7066,"executionStatus":"34","data":"47"},{"startTime":1760156232920,"executionIndex":5,"source":"48","hints":"49","executionTime":2,"executionStatus":"34","data":"50"},{"startTime":1760156232923,"executionIndex":6,"source":"51","hints":"52","executionTime":21,"executionStatus":"34","data":"53"},{"startTime":1760156232944,"executionIndex":7,"source":"54","hints":"55","executionTime":0,"executionStatus":"34","data":"56"},{},{},[],[],"success",{"main":"57"},["58"],[],{"main":"59"},["60"],[],{"main":"61"},["62"],[],{"main":"63"},["64"],[],{"main":"65"},["66"],[],{"main":"67"},["68"],[],{"main":"69"},["70"],[],{"main":"71"},["72"],{"previousNode":"73"},["74"],{"previousNode":"75"},["76"],{"previousNode":"75"},["77","78","79"],{"previousNode":"80"},["81"],{"previousNode":"82"},["83"],{"previousNode":"84"},["85"],{"previousNode":"84"},["86"],["87"],"When clicking ‘Execute workflow’",["88"],"Edit Fields",["89"],["90"],[],[],"Select Provider",["91"],"OpenAI",["92"],"Normalize OpenAI",["93"],["94"],{"json":"95","pairedItem":"96"},{"json":"97","pairedItem":"98"},{"json":"99","pairedItem":"100"},{"json":"97","pairedItem":"101"},{"json":"102","pairedItem":"103"},{"json":"104","pairedItem":"105"},{"json":"106","pairedItem":"107"},{"json":"104","pairedItem":"108"},{},{"item":0},{"source":"109","taskId":"110","conversationId":"111","userId":"112","provider":"113","model":"114","system-message":"115","user-message":"116","stepName":"117","sequence":"118","statusWebhook":"119","totalSteps":"120"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"121","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"122"},{"item":0},{"text":null,"provider":"113","model":null,"usage":null},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"click","a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901","c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012","openai","gpt-4o","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Creating Blog Post ","1","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","3",{"role":"123","content":"124","refusal":null,"annotations":"125"},"stop","assistant","Exciting News: Introducing Orchestrator AI – Your Small Business's New Best Friend!\\n\\nHey there, small business owners! We know how busy and challenging managing a small business can be — juggling customer needs, staff, inventory, marketing, and all the little things that keep your dream alive. That’s why we’re thrilled to share some fantastic news that we believe will make your life a whole lot easier.\\n\\nMeet **Orchestrator AI**, our brand-new product crafted specifically with small businesses in mind. Think of it as your intelligent assistant that helps streamline your operations, boost productivity, and free up more time for what you love most — growing your business and serving your customers.\\n\\n### What is Orchestrator AI?\\n\\nAt its core, Orchestrator AI is an easy-to-use, powerful platform powered by artificial intelligence. It’s designed to unify and coordinate your various business processes — from customer management and inventory tracking to marketing and team communication. Instead of juggling multiple tools or relying on manual work, Orchestrator AI acts as the conductor of your business orchestra, ensuring everything runs smoothly and in harmony.\\n\\n### Why Small Businesses Will Love It\\n\\nHere’s what makes Orchestrator AI a game-changer:\\n\\n- **Simplifies Complex Tasks:** Automate routine operations like appointment scheduling, invoicing, and follow-up emails so you can focus on your customers.\\n- **Boosts Efficiency:** By integrating different parts of your business, it reduces duplicated effort and minimizes errors.\\n- **Affordable & User-Friendly:** Designed with small business budgets in mind, and easy enough for anyone to get started without needing a tech degree.\\n- **Customizable:** Tailor workflows to match your unique business needs — no cookie-cutter solutions here!\\n\\n### How Can Orchestrator AI Help Your Business?\\n\\nImagine having a virtual team member who never sleeps, constantly optimizing your workflows. Here are just a few ways Orchestrator AI can make a real difference:\\n\\n- **Customer Experience:** Send personalized follow-ups, gather feedback, and respond swiftly to inquiries.\\n- **Inventory Management:** Keep track of stock levels, alert you when items run low, and even predict future demand.\\n- **Marketing Automation:** Launch email campaigns, social media posts, or promotions automatically, reaching your audience at the right moments.\\n- **Team Collaboration:** Improve communication within your team — assign tasks, share updates, and manage schedules seamlessly.\\n\\n### Why Now?\\n\\nTime is money, and the sooner you adopt smarter tools, the sooner you’ll see results. Orchestrator AI is ready to help you navigate the growing pains of a small business and set you up for scalable success.\\n\\n### Want to Learn More?\\n\\nWe’re excited to help small businesses thrive with Orchestrator AI. Stay tuned for demos, tutorials, and special introductory offers coming your way soon. Ready to take your business to the next level? Don’t hesitate to reach out — we’re here to support you every step of the way.\\n\\nThanks for being part of our community — here’s to smarter, more efficient business days ahead!\\n\\n**Stay connected, stay inspired, and let Orchestrator AI orchestrate your success!**",[]]
