ge":"130","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"131"},{"item":0},{"text":"132","provider":"119","model":"120"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","We'd like to announce our new product Orchestrator AI for Small Companies!","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You are a social media content strategist. Create engaging social media posts (NOT blog posts) for multiple platforms: Twitter/X (280 chars with hashtags), LinkedIn (professional tone, 1300 chars max), and Facebook (conversational, 500 chars). Focus on hooks, engagement, and platform-specific best practices. Include relevant hashtags and emojis where appropriate.","Create Social Media","3","Create Social Media ",{"role":"133","content":"132","refusal":null,"annotations":"134"},"stop","**Twitter/X:**\\n\\n🎉 Exciting News for Small Businesses! 🎉 Unleash the power of #AI with our new product, Orchestrator AI! Automate tasks, boost efficiency, and scale like never before. Ready to transform your business? 🚀 #SmallBusiness #Innovation #TechTrends\\n\\n**LinkedIn:**\\n\\n🌟 Introducing Orchestrator AI for Small Companies! 🌟\\n\\nIn the dynamic world of business, staying ahead means embracing innovation. Today, we're thrilled to unveil Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses ready to scale new heights. Our latest product empowers you to automate routine tasks, optimize operations, and focus on strategic growth—all with the power of AI. 🚀\\n\\nWith Orchestrator AI, you can reduce overhead costs, improve accuracy, and increase productivity, allowing your team to focus on what truly matters: driving success and creativity in your industry. Imagine spending less time on routine tasks and more on innovation and growth.\\n\\n💡 Curious about how Orchestrator AI can transform your business? Let's connect and explore the endless possibilities to elevate your business to new heights! \\n\\n#SmallBusiness #OrchestratorAI #Innovation #BusinessGrowth #Efficiency #Automation\\n\\n**Facebook:**\\n\\n🚀 Introducing something NEW for small businesses! Meet Orchestrator AI—your path to smoother operations and smarter growth. 😊 Whether you're tired of juggling tasks or aiming to streamline processes, our product simplifies it all with the magic of AI. Save time, cut overheads, and focus on what you love—growing your business! 🌟\\n\\nHave questions on how it works? We’d love to chat! Drop your thoughts or questions below. Let’s revolutionize the way small businesses thrive together!\\n\\n#SmallBusinessMagic #OrchestratorAI #Innovation #AIRevolution 😉","assistant",[]]
