ge":"130","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"131"},{"item":0},{"text":"132","provider":"119","model":"120"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","We'd like to announce our new product Orchestrator AI for Small Companies!","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You are a social media content strategist. Create engaging social media posts (NOT blog posts) for multiple platforms: Twitter/X (280 chars with hashtags), LinkedIn (professional tone, 1300 chars max), and Facebook (conversational, 500 chars). Focus on hooks, engagement, and platform-specific best practices. Include relevant hashtags and emojis where appropriate.","Create Social Media","3","Create Social Media ",{"role":"133","content":"132","refusal":null,"annotations":"134"},"stop","**Twitter/X:**\\n\\n🎉 Exciting News! 🎉 Introducing Orchestrator AI for Small Companies! 🚀 The ultimate AI tool to streamline your business operations, save time, and boost productivity. Ready to elevate your business game? Say hello to effortless efficiency! 🤖💼 #SmallBiz #OrchestratorAI #Innovation\\n\\n**LinkedIn:**\\n\\n🌟 Major Announcement for Small Businesses! 🌟\\n\\nWe're thrilled to introduce Orchestrator AI for Small Companies - your new business partner for the digital age! 🚀 Tailored to meet the unique challenges of small enterprises, Orchestrator AI is designed to streamline your operations, increase efficiency, and drive success. \\n\\nWhy choose Orchestrator AI?\\n\\n🔹 **Efficiency Redefined:** Automate routine tasks to focus on what truly matters - growing your business.\\n\\n🔹 **Cost-Effective:** Crafted for small business budgets while delivering big enterprise capabilities.\\n\\n🔹 **Scalable Solutions:** Designed with flexibility in mind, grow with AI that adapts to your evolving needs.\\n\\n🔹 **Enhanced Productivity:** Let AI handle the backstage, while you take center stage in innovation and customer engagement.\\n\\nUnlock new opportunities and elevate your small business to new heights. Get started with Orchestrator AI today and join a league of forward-thinking companies! 🌐🤝\\n\\nConnect with us for more insights or a demo. Together, let's orchestrate success! #OrchestratorAI #SmallBusinessGrowth #Innovation\\n\\n**Facebook:**\\n\\n🎊 Hey everyone! We're excited to roll out Orchestrator AI for Small Companies! 🚀 This game-changing tool is here to help small businesses like yours manage operations more efficiently and affordably. \\n\\nImagine having a smart assistant that helps automate tasks, streamline processes, and boost productivity so you can focus on what you do best - growing your business and serving your customers! 🤖✨\\n\\nReady to see what Orchestrator AI can do for you? Let's make business management a breeze together! Get in touch for a demo or more details. Comment \\"AI\\" below, and join the future of small business management today! 💬📈 #OrchestratorAI #SmallBusinessSolution #InnovateAndGrow","assistant",[]]
