Index":2,"source":"38","hints":"39","executionTime":4,"executionStatus":"33","data":"40"},{"startTime":1760158507971,"executionIndex":3,"source":"41","hints":"42","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"43"},{"startTime":1760158507972,"executionIndex":4,"source":"44","hints":"45","executionTime":17119,"executionStatus":"33","data":"46"},{"startTime":1760158525091,"executionIndex":5,"source":"47","hints":"48","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"49"},{"startTime":1760158525092,"executionIndex":6,"source":"50","hints":"51","executionTime":22,"executionStatus":"33","data":"52"},{"startTime":1760158525114,"executionIndex":7,"source":"53","hints":"54","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"55"},[],[],{"parentExecution":"4"},"success",{"main":"56"},["57"],[],{"main":"58"},["59"],[],{"main":"60"},["61"],[],{"main":"62"},["63"],[],{"main":"64"},["65"],[],{"main":"66"},["67"],[],{"main":"68"},["69"],[],{"main":"70"},["71"],{"previousNode":"72"},["73"],{"previousNode":"74"},["75"],{"previousNode":"74"},["76","77","78"],{"previousNode":"79"},["80"],{"previousNode":"81"},["82"],{"previousNode":"83"},["84"],{"previousNode":"83"},["85"],["86"],"Trigger",["87"],"Edit Fields",["88"],["89"],[],[],"Select Provider",["90"],"OpenAI",["91"],"Normalize OpenAI",["92"],["93"],{"json":"94","index":0,"pairedItem":"95"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"97"},{"json":"98","pairedItem":"99"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"100"},{"json":"101","pairedItem":"102"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"104"},{"json":"105","pairedItem":"106"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"107"},{"provider":"108","model":"109","announcement":"110","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","statusWebhook":"114","system-message":"115","user-message":"110","stepName":"116","sequence":"117","totalSteps":"118"},{"item":0},{"source":"119","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","provider":"108","model":"109","system-message":"120","user-message":"121","stepName":"122","sequence":"117","statusWebhook":"114","totalSteps":"118"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"123","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"124"},{"item":0},{"text":"125","provider":"108","model":"109"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","Blog post content has been generated","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You understand SEO better than anyone.  You can find the best SEO for a range of topics.","Create SEO","2","3","click","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Create SEO ",{"role":"126","content":"125","refusal":null,"annotations":"127"},"stop","**Unleashing the Power of Small Businesses with Orchestrator AI: Your New Digital Maestro**\\n\\n🎉 Exciting News! 🎉 Small businesses, gather 'round! In a world where efficiency meets innovation, we are thrilled to unveil a groundbreaking addition to your entrepreneurial toolkit: Orchestrator AI! Designed with the nimbleness of a hummingbird and the prowess of a scale-topping symphony, this state-of-the-art product is ready to turn your business dreams into harmonious realities. So, what is Orchestrator AI, and how can it transform the way you rock and roll in your industry? Let’s dive in.\\n\\n### Conducting Your Business Symphony\\n\\nPicture this: you have a small business with huge aspirations. You're juggling client meetings, staff schedules, inventory nightmares, and an avalanche of emails that grows more merciless by the hour. Sounds chaotic? Enter Orchestrator AI, your digital maestro, skilled in conducting a symphony of business operations with ease and precision.\\n\\nThis isn’t just any AI—this one's got groove! Orchestrator AI helps you automate routine processes, streamline communication, and manage your resources all with the finesse of a seasoned conductor. No need to worry about missing a beat; we've got your back in orchestrating effortless efficiency from start to finish.\\n\\n### A Symphony Crafted for Small Business\\n\\nYou might be wondering, “Why is this AI specifically for small businesses?” Great question!\\n\\n1. **Tailored Virtuosity**: Understanding that each small business is as unique as a musical note, Orchestrator AI is designed to adapt to various scales and industries. Whether you're a butcher, a baker, or an artisan candlestick maker, our AI molds around your operational tempo, ensuring a perfect fit.\\n\\n2. **Resource-Friendly**: We know budgets can be tight, and investments require careful decision-making. Orchestrator AI provides high-octane performance without burning through your resources, leaving ample room for growth and innovation.\\n\\n3. **Easy to Learn, Easier to Master**: With a no-fuss user experience, anyone can become an Orchestrator AI maestro. Forget learning curves; think of it as learning a catchy tune—straightforward, sensible, and highly rewarding!\\n\\n### Harmonizing Success and Innovation\\n\\nWhat sets Orchestrator AI apart from the cacophony of other business tools? Its ability to seamlessly integrate into your existing systems without causing disruption. Playing nicely with the team of tools you've already cultivated, this AI ensures a smooth blend into your business operations, making it the linchpin of your business ecosystem.\\n\\nBy investing in Orchestrator AI, you're not just acquiring a tool; you're gaining a partner in innovation and progress. The AI handles mundane tasks, allowing you to focus on the creative and human aspects that truly drive customer satisfaction and business growth.\\n\\n### The Crescendo of Your Business Journey\\n\\nOrchestrator AI isn't just a product; it's a promise to every small business owner tirelessly working towards their goals. It's the support you need when the workload threatens to muffle your entrepreneurial tune and the empowerment to transform your business into a masterpiece of efficiency and success.\\n\\nSo, let's strike up the band and get your small business crescendo-ing to new heights! It’s time to conduct your enterprise with the seamless brilliance of Orchestrator AI. The concert of your business journey awaits, with standing ovations on the horizon. Ready to take the stage? Let's get started! 🎶\\n\\nStay tuned for more updates and innovations as we continue to refine Orchestrator AI, ensuring that its symphony of success harmonizes perfectly with your business needs. Keep orchestrating, keep innovating, and, most importantly, keep enjoying the entrepreneurial melody.\\n\\nLet Orchestrator AI be the virtuoso behind your business' unrivaled success. ","assistant",[]]
