Webhook":"114","totalSteps":"118"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"123","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"124"},{"item":0},{"text":"125","provider":"108","model":"109"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","Blog post content has been generated","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You understand SEO better than anyone.  You can find the best SEO for a range of topics.","Create SEO","2","3","click","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Create SEO ",{"role":"126","content":"125","refusal":null,"annotations":"127"},"stop","Title: Introducing Orchestrator AI: The Small Business Maestro!\\n\\n---\\n\\n🎉 Attention, small business owners! 🎉\\n\\nReady to meet your new best friend in the digital world? It’s time to roll out the red carpet and pop the confetti because we are thrilled to unveil our latest marvel – Orchestrator AI, the game-changer that’s tailor-made for small businesses like yours!\\n\\n### Small Businesses, Big Dreams\\n\\nRunning a small business is no small feat. You’ve gotta wear a thousand hats – marketer, accountant, human resources guru, and maybe even part-time barista when the going gets tough! We get it. Your dream deserves more focus and far less chaos. Enter Orchestrator AI, the AI ally you never knew you needed but now won’t be able to live without.\\n\\n### The Symphony to Your Business Hustle\\n\\nOrchestrator AI isn’t just another tool; it’s your personal business maestro, conducting operations with genius precision. Imagine having advanced technology that harmonizes every aspect of your business operations while you sit back, relax, and watch your dreams flourish.\\n\\n#### Why Orchestrator AI?\\n\\n- **Effortless Efficiency**: Orchestrator AI is designed to streamline operations. From automating mundane tasks to providing sharp insights into business metrics, it’s all about freeing up time for those espresso breaks you love.\\n\\n- **Tailored for the Little Giant**: Unlike the one-size-fits-all solutions, this AI is specifically engineered with small businesses in mind, ensuring that it grows alongside your business’s unique needs.\\n\\n- **Data-Driven Decisions**: With Orchestrator AI, making decisions becomes as easy as pie (or making one). Get advice based on solid data analysis rather than guesswork, ensuring every step you take is a step in the right direction.\\n\\n- **Customer Experience Upgrade**: Love your customers but overwhelmed by CRM tasks? Let Orchestrator AI handle it. Enhance customer relations with personalized interactions that keep your business’s heartbeat strong.\\n\\n### Let’s Chat Implementation\\n\\nGetting started with Orchestrator AI is smoother than your morning latte. With an easy setup process, you’ll transition into this new phase of business management without the headaches of tech tantrums or hair-pulling installations.\\n\\n### The AI Anthem for Small Businesses\\n\\nSay goodbye to tedious busywork and hello to time management on steroids. Orchestrator AI isn't just another app—it's your business’s new anthem for success. It’s time to compose your story with flair, creativity, and efficiency.\\n\\n### Join the Orchestrator AI Family\\n\\nWe are beyond excited to welcome you into the Orchestrator AI family. Watch your small business dream step into the spotlight and flourish like never before. Join a community of forward-thinking entrepreneurs who are redefining small business success with a powerful partner by their side.\\n\\n---\\n\\nReady to transform the way you do business? Embrace Orchestrator AI – where your entrepreneurial dreams become the star of their own grand symphony.\\n\\nStay tuned for exciting updates and insider tips on how Orchestrator AI can elevate your business to superstar status. 🌟\\n\\nHere’s to your success!\\n\\n---\\n\\nHey, we’d love to hear from you! Have questions or exciting stories about your Orchestrator AI experience? Drop us a line or hit the comments below. Let’s celebrate your business milestones together! 🎶","assistant",[]]
