tus":"33","data":"34"},{"startTime":1760161366156,"executionIndex":1,"source":"35","hints":"36","executionTime":4,"executionStatus":"33","data":"37"},{"startTime":1760161366160,"executionIndex":2,"source":"38","hints":"39","executionTime":5,"executionStatus":"33","data":"40"},{"startTime":1760161366165,"executionIndex":3,"source":"41","hints":"42","executionTime":0,"executionStatus":"33","data":"43"},{"startTime":1760161366165,"executionIndex":4,"source":"44","hints":"45","executionTime":7987,"executionStatus":"33","data":"46"},{"startTime":1760161374152,"executionIndex":5,"source":"47","hints":"48","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"49"},{"startTime":1760161374153,"executionIndex":6,"source":"50","hints":"51","executionTime":18,"executionStatus":"33","data":"52"},{"startTime":1760161374171,"executionIndex":7,"source":"53","hints":"54","executionTime":1,"executionStatus":"33","data":"55"},[],[],{"parentExecution":"4"},"success",{"main":"56"},["57"],[],{"main":"58"},["59"],[],{"main":"60"},["61"],[],{"main":"62"},["63"],[],{"main":"64"},["65"],[],{"main":"66"},["67"],[],{"main":"68"},["69"],[],{"main":"70"},["71"],{"previousNode":"72"},["73"],{"previousNode":"74"},["75"],{"previousNode":"74"},["76","77","78"],{"previousNode":"79"},["80"],{"previousNode":"81"},["82"],{"previousNode":"83"},["84"],{"previousNode":"83"},["85"],["86"],"Trigger",["87"],"Edit Fields",["88"],["89"],[],[],"Select Provider",["90"],"OpenAI",["91"],"Normalize OpenAI",["92"],["93"],{"json":"94","index":0,"pairedItem":"95"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"97"},{"json":"98","pairedItem":"99"},{"json":"96","pairedItem":"100"},{"json":"101","pairedItem":"102"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"104"},{"json":"105","pairedItem":"106"},{"json":"103","pairedItem":"107"},{"provider":"108","model":"109","announcement":"110","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","statusWebhook":"114","system-message":"115","user-message":"110","stepName":"116","sequence":"117","totalSteps":"118"},{"item":0},{"source":"119","taskId":"111","conversationId":"112","userId":"113","provider":"108","model":"109","system-message":"120","user-message":"121","stepName":"122","sequence":"117","statusWebhook":"114","totalSteps":"118"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},{"index":0,"message":"123","logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"124"},{"item":0},{"text":"125","provider":"108","model":"109"},{"item":0},{},{"item":0},{"item":0},"openai","gpt-4o","We'd like to announce our new product Orchestrator AI for Small Companies!","a1b2c3d4-5e6f-7890-abcd-ef1234567890","c6d7e8f9-0a1b-2c3d-4e5f-678901234567","u5e6f7a8-9b0c-1d2e-3f4a-567890123456","http://host.docker.internal:7100/webhooks/status","You are an expert SEO specialist. Generate comprehensive SEO-optimized content including: meta title (60 chars max), meta description (155 chars max), 5-10 relevant keywords, H1 heading, and JSON-LD structured data for the given topic. Focus on search intent, readability, and technical SEO best practices.","Create SEO","2","3","click","You are a brilliant blog post writer who specializes in being both entertaining and informative, and you're best known for being able to write posts for all audiences. ","We are proud to announce our new product, Orchestrator AI, designed specifically for small businesses. ","Create SEO ",{"role":"126","content":"125","refusal":null,"annotations":"127"},"stop","**Title: Orchestrator AI: The Virtual Conductor for Your Small Business Symphony**\\n\\nLadies and gentlemen, gather around! It's showtime, and the curtains are rising on a revolutionary performance in the world of small business management. Allow me to introduce you to the latest virtuoso in the tech industry’s symphony—Orchestrator AI.\\n\\nOrchestrator AI isn't just another tech gadget; it’s the maestro your small business has been waiting for. Imagine having a virtual conductor that synchronizes your operations, streamlines processes, and transforms your business into a masterpiece of efficiency. Prepare to be both dazzled and informed as we dive into the world of Orchestrator AI!\\n\\n**The Vision Beyond the Notes**\\n\\nFor those who hear “AI” and imagine robots doing the cha-cha, let's clarify: Orchestrator AI isn't here to take over in a dramatic robot uprising. No, this AI is more like the friendly next-door neighbor with a knack for problem-solving—and snacks (metaphorically speaking). Designed specifically for small businesses, it understands the unique challenges you face, from budget constraints to the never-ending quest for efficiency. \\n\\n**Key Features: The Instruments in Our Ensemble**\\n\\n1. **Melodious Automation**: Say goodbye to manual drudgery and hello to productivity. Orchestrator AI automates repetitive tasks, giving you more time to focus on what matters most—growing your business.\\n\\n2. **Harmony in Communication**: Effective communication is the backbone of any successful business. This magical tool ensures your team stays in tune, minimizing misunderstandings and fostering collaboration.\\n\\n3. **Data’s Sweet Symphony**: Data is the modern-day gold. Orchestrator AI collects, analyzes, and transforms your data into actionable insights. Watch as your business decisions become as precise as a virtuoso’s crescendo.\\n\\n4. **Personalized Performance**: Orchestrator AI isn’t a one-size-fits-all suit. It adapts to fit the specific needs of your business, creating a seamless integration that feels like it was tailor-made.\\n\\n**Encore: Real-World Impact**\\n\\nNow, let's take a bow and look at the applause Orchestrator AI is already receiving. Imagine a boutique bakery in Brooklyn that transformed its operations, or a microbrewery in Milwaukee harmonizing its supply chain—all thanks to the efficiency and insights of Orchestrator AI. These aren’t fairy tales or fables; they’re success stories being written in real-time.\\n\\n**Finale: Your Business's Standing Ovation**\\n\\nWhether you're a spirited startup or a seasoned business owner looking for a fresh act, Orchestrator AI is ready to take center stage. It's here to fine-tune your processes, energize your team, and lead your business to a standing ovation of success.\\n\\nSo, what are you waiting for? It’s time to let Orchestrator AI conduct the symphony of your small business, ensuring every note is pitch perfect. Here's to a future filled with efficiency, growth, and, of course, a little bit of magic. 🎶\\n\\nLadies and gentlemen, the Orchestrator AI show is about to begin—grab your front row tickets!","assistant",[]]
